{"sha": "2fbcd569e7852a8ae9b55bd74943191fe635bd70e14086939a4f73ce4c5dd5ce", "body": ["\\chapter{分数与幂}\\label{ch:g9:fractions}", "", "分数与幂是计算中的常用工具，可用于分配", "数量、比较比例、书写很大或很小的", "数。本章整理分数与幂的运算规则 ---", "每个中间步骤都写出来 ---", "并引入科学记数法。", "", "\\section{分数的运算}", "", "\\begin{definition}[分数]\\label{def:g9:fractions:fraction}", "形如 $\\dfrac ab$（$b \\neq 0$）的数称为\\emph{分数}\\index{分数}，它是", "即 $a$ 除以 $b$ 的商。若两分数中一个可由", "另一个通过将分子与分母同乘（或同除）", "以同一非零数得到，则两分数相等：", "\\[", "\\frac ab = \\frac{a \\times k}{b \\times k} \\qquad (k \\neq 0).", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g9:fractions:simplify}", "逐步化简 $\\dfrac{42}{56}$：", "\\[", "\\frac{42}{56} = \\frac{42 \\div 2}{56 \\div 2} = \\frac{21}{28}", "= \\frac{21 \\div 7}{28 \\div 7} = \\frac34 .", "\\]", "（在\\cref{ch:g9:arith}中，最大公因数", "可以一步完成这一化简。）", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{method}[分数的加减法]\\label{met:g9:fractions:add}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 将两个分数通分，取\\emph{公分母}（两个分母的", "        公倍数）；", "  \\item 将分子相加或相减，分母保持不变；", "  \\item 若可能，将结果化简。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g9:fractions:add}", "计算 $\\dfrac56 + \\dfrac34$。$6$ 与 $4$ 的一个公分母是", "$12$：", "\\[", "\\frac56 + \\frac34", "= \\frac{5 \\times 2}{6 \\times 2} + \\frac{3 \\times 3}{4 \\times 3}", "= \\frac{10}{12} + \\frac{9}{12}", "= \\frac{19}{12}.", "\\]", "计算 $2 - \\dfrac37$。将 $2$ 写成分母为 $7$ 的分数：", "\\[", "2 - \\frac37 = \\frac{14}{7} - \\frac37 = \\frac{11}{7}.", "\\]", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.55]", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,11}", "    \\draw[omExo] ({mod(\\i,12)},0) rectangle ({mod(\\i,12)+1},1);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,9}", "    \\fill[omDef!35] (\\i,0) rectangle (\\i+1,1);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (12,1);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (6,-0.1)", "    {$\\frac56 = \\frac{10}{12}$：12 格中的 10 格};", "  \\begin{scope}[yshift=-2.4cm]", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,11}", "    \\draw[omExo] (\\i,0) rectangle (\\i+1,1);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,8}", "    \\fill[omThm!35] (\\i,0) rectangle (\\i+1,1);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (12,1);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (6,-0.1)", "    {$\\frac34 = \\frac{9}{12}$：12 格中的 9 格};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 为何要通分：将两个整体各切成 $12$ 个", "等大的格子，这样两个分数便于比较、便于相加 ---", "合计为 $10 + 9 = 19$ 个十二分之一。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[分数的乘除法]\\label{met:g9:fractions:mult}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 相乘时，分别将分子与分子、分母与分母", "        相乘：$\\dfrac ab \\times \\dfrac cd = \\dfrac{ac}{bd}$", "        （只要可能，应\\emph{先约分}再相乘）；", "  \\item 相除时，乘以除数的倒数：", "        $\\dfrac ab \\div \\dfrac cd = \\dfrac ab \\times \\dfrac dc$.", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g9:fractions:mult}", "\\[", "\\frac{7}{15} \\times \\frac{25}{14}", "= \\frac{7 \\times 25}{15 \\times 14}", "= \\frac{7 \\times 25}{15 \\times 2 \\times 7}", "= \\frac{25}{30} = \\frac56,", "\\]", "其中先约去公因数 $7$，再约去 $5$。再看一个", "除法的例子：", "\\[", "\\frac{3}{4} \\div \\frac{9}{8}", "= \\frac34 \\times \\frac89", "= \\frac{3 \\times 8}{4 \\times 9}", "= \\frac{24}{36} = \\frac23 .", "\\]", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{幂}", "", "\\begin{definition}[幂]\\label{def:g9:fractions:power}", "对实数 $a$ 与正整数 $n$，", "\\emph{幂}\\index{幂} $a^n$ 是 $n$ 个等于", "$a$ 的因数之积：", "\\[", "a^n = \\underbrace{a \\times a \\times \\dots \\times a}_{n \\text{ 个因数}} .", "\\]", "按约定，$a^0 = 1$（$a \\neq 0$），负指数", "表示倒数：", "\\[", "a^{-n} = \\frac{1}{a^n}.", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", ""]}